# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (never commit .dev.vars).
# Set production values using Wrangler secrets as described in docs/setup.md.

# Optional. Only for enabling AI (AI Gateway Edit) or the advanced in-app domain
# connection. Mail domains are connected with "pnpm run domain example.com".
# CF_API_TOKEN=replace-me
# Non-secret CF_ACCOUNT_ID and OWNER_EMAIL live in wrangler.jsonc vars.

# The installer generates both secrets below on the first deployment and keeps
# them; nobody has to make or paste them. Set them here only for local development.

# Agent auth (required for /api/agent/* and /mcp; those routes 503 without it).
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# AGENT_JWT_SECRET=replace-me-base64-32-bytes

# Root for every other key: signed links and images in mail, tracking tokens,
# raw-download URLs, the domain-connection cookie, Cloudflare OAuth token
# sealing and webhook secret sealing. Keep it different from AGENT_JWT_SECRET.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# BOXOX_SIGNING_SECRET=replace-me-base64-32-bytes

# Optional: Cloudflare Access instead of Box Ox passkey sign-in. With both set,
# Access decides who is signed in.
# ACCESS_AUD=
# TEAM_DOMAIN=https://<team>.cloudflareaccess.com
